WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.467
Open Resize images with a photo or the built-in sample.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:14.933
Keep the aspect ratio locked. Set Width to 800 pixels.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:22.400
Select Resize photo and check the output dimensions.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:29.867
Choose Download photo to keep your resized image.
